    },
    {
        "text": "The sun sets in the west."
    },
    {
        "text": "Both the people and the city walls cast long shadows, covering the stalls by the road. A vendor closes his umbrella and yawns."
    },
    {
        "text": "Closing up! 30% off on what's left so I can go home for dinner!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yawning Vendor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just go. Tourists these days don't care about your toy weapons anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bored Vendor"
    },
    {
        "text": "I would have joined the army if I had the skills to forge real swords.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yawning Vendor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Say, I saw a tourist carrying a blood-red sword yesterday. Now that was something unusual. I wonder where it came from...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bored Vendor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "The girl looks around, perplexed. She has never seen a scene like this before."
    },
    {
        "text": "The ground rumbles slightly underneath her feet, likely a sign that the nomadic city is decelerating. The people on the streets seem completely unperturbed by it, going about their business as usual."
    },
    {
        "text": "She smells the aroma of food, and remembers that she has not eaten for two days."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jieyun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "The soreness all over her body hits at the same time as the hunger."
    },
    {
        "text": "Her legs take on a mind of their own, following the scent to a restaurant."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "25_g04_yaninn",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_doorbell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_303_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What would you like?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waiter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Er... whatever that person is having.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jieyun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_303_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cold noodles with roasted meat for table three!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waiter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is near dinner time, and the place is almost full. A good, hearty dinner is the most comforting thing for honest, working people who have been busy all day."
    },
    {
        "text": "The TV on the wall plays a martial arts drama on repeat, the familiar story occasionally catching the attention of the customers."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Why does the man in the box look like him?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jieyun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(The swordswoman next to him looks a little like Shifu, but not quite the same...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jieyun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(What does 'adapted from true events' mean?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jieyun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_303_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_glassclink"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your noodles, miss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waiter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "T-Thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jieyun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "I say a hundred-meter scroll signed by every single person in town. Now that's a meaningful gift!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ni sha le ma? The Grandmaster is going on a journey. How is he gonna carry that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk B"
    },
    {
        "text": "Better to have something practical, like some local food for him to eat on the way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk B"
    },
    {
        "text": "How many years has the Grandmaster protected Yumen?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk A"
    },
    {
        "text": "All I know that he's been around since before my dad was born.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk B"
    },
    {
        "text": "He must be more than a hundred! No wonder he's leaving his post. It must take a toll on him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk A"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I've heard some jianghu wanderers say that they've seen him lately, and he still looks like he's middle-aged.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk B"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait... is he immortal or something?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk A"
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard there are those who live much longer than normal, thanks to Arts. The Grandmaster must be one of those.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk B"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyway, the one thing everyone should remember is that he's the hero and protector of Yumen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk B"
    },
    {
        "text": "Never heard about a spouse or kids, though. What a shame, when you consider that General Zuo's son has already reached adulthood...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(They called him a hero?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jieyun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_303_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How did you like your meal, miss?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waiter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was very good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jieyun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_303_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, the bill...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waiter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jieyun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_243_waaifu_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll take care of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Th-Thank you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jieyun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_243_waaifu_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure... Now how about that, we meet again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you lose your wallet, or just forgot?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... lost it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jieyun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_243_waaifu_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ouch, that's unlucky.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like you're new around here. I'm guessing you don't really know the place? I'll go with you to report the loss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Th-Thank you, but I'm fine...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jieyun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I-I'll pay you back next time!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jieyun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_243_waaifu_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jieyun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_243_waaifu_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this the sword you said you were looking for?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you trying to take it too?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jieyun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_243_waaifu_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you think I am, a thief?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_243_waaifu_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I've heard rumors that a special sword went missing. Could it be...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I have to go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jieyun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
