    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_785_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_785_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who's there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Huai Tianpei"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_785_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Show yourself!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Huai Tianpei"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$warm_intro",
        "key": "$warm_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "They say you don't try this with martial artists.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_295_1#8$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Especially not with <i>the</i> martial artist.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_295_1#8$1",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Am I a goner if he just takes a swing by instinct without looking?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_295_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then I would have to arrest him for manslaughter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_785_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Huai Tianpei"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_295_1#8$1",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, did I win the bet?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_295_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You did.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I had a bet with Liang Xun over how you'd react when you saw us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "text": "He said you would turn around and leave, but I said you would freeze on the spot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_295_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Never seen one who could read others better than you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, he <i>is</i> my oath-brother. Not exactly a stranger.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_785_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Huai Tianpei"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_295_1#8$1",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry, Waai Fu doesn't know you're here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "text": "A reunion of father and daughter calls for a grander occasion, after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not like our lord magistrate over here, who drags me into trouble the first time we see each other in a dozen years.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_295_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I know I owe you one...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is it too much sarcasm if I keep harping on this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_785_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Huai Tianpei"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, there's no one else here, just the three of us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have wine and food. Shall we sit down and chat?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
