    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$ponder_intro",
        "key": "$ponder_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$transmission"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_033",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The locations of all the suspicious warehouses have been sent to your terminals.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lungmen Tourist?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Check them one by one, going from east to west. Move quickly; time is short.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lungmen Tourist?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't do anything rash, if you find something. Contact the others, and we'll move in togeth\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lungmen Tourist?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Were you looking for me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meng Tieyi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_033"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lungmen Tourist?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 0.3
    },
    {
        "text": "He reacts quickly. Years of experience have taught him when it is time to fight, and when it is time for flight."
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 17,
        "ystrength": 8,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "As soon as he turns around, however, he feels a hand on his shoulder, immobilizing him."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_033",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_789_1#10$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "-50,0",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_789_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are you trying to run, if you're looking for me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meng Tieyi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_033",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lungmen Tourist?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_789_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sharp, but not enough guts. Fix that, and there's potential for bigger things for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meng Tieyi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "posfrom": "-50,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The old man withdraws his hand."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_789_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell Miss Lin that I will be waiting for her at the warehouse in the southern city, on fifth street, block seven, at the Hour of Shen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meng Tieyi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "250,0",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "200,0",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_785_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "-300,0",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "35_g13_yanlivingroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$newhope01_intro",
        "key": "$newhope01_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_785_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Huai Tianpei"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#8$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Not drinking?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm still on duty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_785_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alcohol isn't good for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Huai Tianpei"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, what are we gonna do if we're not drinking or talking? Just stare at each other?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't you have something to ask him, Mr. Liang?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_295_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I could ask you the same.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have we gotten to the point that we can't talk while sober?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_785_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you have something to say, say it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Huai Tianpei"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What have you been doing...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_785_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wandering.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Huai Tianpei"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looking for strong opponents in each new place, until there's no one left. Then I move on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Huai Tianpei"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I had to study Mr. Liang to see what the changes were over the years. You, Waai, or I guess Huai, you wear them on your face.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_785_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What changed?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Huai Tianpei"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You got old.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_785_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's obvious.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Huai Tianpei"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was actually worried I was going to hear someday that you died in a duel.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_785_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Would I?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Huai Tianpei"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's always someone better, as they say...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So... how long have you been in Yumen?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_785_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Three years.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Huai Tianpei"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's someone here who promised to fight me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Huai Tianpei"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_785_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "He said it could take three years, five years, ten years, maybe more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Huai Tianpei"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_295_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huai Tianpei, so obsessed with earning fame, learning patience...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_785_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's a few years here? There's no one else to fight anyway.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Huai Tianpei"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So you've been working at the clinic for three years.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$pourwater"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "The scent of herbal medicine covers up the aroma of the wine. There is nothing left but a bitter taste."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Pulsatilla yanensis', 'psychotria rubra', 'zanthoxylum avicennae', 'senecio scandens'...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "text": "I spent almost a month asking the various schools, never imagining that you were right here in this clinic opposite the inn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_785_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Debts have to be paid.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Huai Tianpei"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then you know who it is you owe the biggest debt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_785_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Huai Tianpei"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's all I have to say. What about you, Mr. Liang?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_295_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just here to see how an old friend is doing. It's not an interrogation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huai Tianpei has been in Yumen for three years. You've been here a while yourself. But you picked this time to visit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_295_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's no time to consider private sentiment, when there is unrest in the city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "In your patriotism, you won't even permit commoners like us to think of private sentiment?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_295_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_785_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll sit for a while longer if you're really here to reminisce about old times.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Huai Tianpei"
    },
    {
        "text": "But look at us, we've gotten to the point where we can't even talk freely?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Huai Tianpei"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huai Tianpei picks up his cup, drinks it dry, and leaves the room."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you get the answer you were looking for, Mr. Liang?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess so.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "As Huai Tianpei's oath-brother, or as the advisor of Yumen?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_295_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I should be used to you seeing through things by now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe you should change your habit of bringing trouble on yourself. At least don't get to the point where you don't even have someone to talk to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's a job he just might be the right man for...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Like how you had me handle that goblet?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing that complicated.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even when he's Huai Tianpei, he's still Waai Tinpui.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's the hardest to change.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about you and I?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_295_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The same flowers, the same wine, but the spirit of youth is no more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's precious enough that we can still sit around the same table and chat a little over a drink. It's a fool's errand to try to go back to the past.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
